      "raw": "\n"
    },
    {
      "id": "b000003",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "start_line": 3,
      "end_line": 5,
      "raw": "C++23, Qt-free LVUI AOT example covering all eight native Card types, three Avatar sizes,\nimmutable background image delivery, reactive properties/factories and retained preview content.\nThe process and frame loop belong to iiSDKCore. iiGUI paints its own widgets.\n"
    },
    {
      "id": "b000004",
      "kind": "blank",
      "start_line": 6,
      "end_line": 6,
      "raw": "\n"
    },
    {
      "id": "b000005",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "start_line": 7,
      "end_line": 10,
      "raw": "Build with the installed `LVRS::LVRS` Native package. `install.sh` compiles and stages into\n`build/install` by default; it never launches the app or runs tests. Pass package locations\nas extra CMake arguments. All runtime validation is deferred to the final whole-goal batch.\nSee [usage](docs/Usage.md) for scope and limitations.\n"
    }
  ],
